{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01956","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 恒敛千金笑 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 恒敛千金笑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉颜恒自敛，羞出镜台前。\n早惑阳城客，今悲华锦筵。\n从军人更远，投喜鹊空传。\n夫壻交河北，迢迢路几千。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}